   "end": 11301,
   "text": "## Security Considerations",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 63,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 11303,
   "end": 11462,
   "text": "⟦0⟧\n  **Important**: The ⟦1⟧ flag is required to execute\n  environment code from the Hub. This is by design for security.",
   "tokens": [
    "<Tip warning={true}>",
    "`trust_remote_code=True`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 64,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 11471,
   "end": 11510,
   "text": "When loading environments from the Hub:",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 65,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 11512,
   "end": 11598,
   "text": "1. **Review the code first**: Visit the repository and inspect ⟦0⟧ before loading",
   "tokens": [
    "`env.py`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 66,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 11599,
   "end": 11668,
   "text": "2. **Pin to commits**: Use specific commit hashes for reproducibility",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 67,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 11669,
   "end": 11745,
   "text": "3. **Check dependencies**: Review ⟦0⟧ for suspicious packages",
   "tokens": [
    "`requirements.txt`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 68,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 11746,
   "end": 11829,
   "text": "4. **Use trusted sources**: Prefer official organizations or well-known researchers",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 69,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 11830,
   "end": 11917,
   "text": "5. **Sandbox if needed**: Run untrusted code in isolated environments (containers, VMs)",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 70,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 11919,
   "end": 11941,
